      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAISIE MOO MOO (8) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (19.63) at this track behind He's A Felon in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from five attempts. Top chance in this line up. TOORA GRACIE (1) had been racing well with a Other win three back then placed next time before missing the frame latest at this track. Expecting sharp improvement this line-up. TRIO OF CLOWNS (4) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Gina Gulla (30.99) in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Leading player again. FIRE FLY TOUKLEY (6) is always hard to beat when drawn in this box.",
